    <readme>README.md</readme>
    <description>Stable redistribution of the exact libplctag.NativeImport 2.0.0-alpha.8 managed assemblies, native runtime libraries, and MSBuild assets for IoT-Driver.ABPlcRx consumers.</description>
    <releaseNotes>Redistributes the exact upstream libplctag.NativeImport 2.0.0-alpha.8 asset graph under MPL-2.0.</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright (c) libplctag contributors. Redistribution packaging copyright (c) Chris Pulman.</copyright>
    <tags>plc modbus netstandard rockwell allen-bradley libplctag native iot</tags>
